{"type":"new","contents":"namespace GW.PrimaMateria\n\nuniverse uCurve uPoint uTarget uBeta uCoh uCycle uCoeff\nuniverse uMod uObst uQH uNov uBModel uASeries uBSeries\nuniverse uOther uDict\n\n/--\nAbstract context for stable-map and GW-style interfaces.\n\nThis is data only. It does not assert that the data correctly formalizes\nGromov-Witten theory.\n-/\nstructure StableMapContext where\n  Curve : Type uCurve\n  Point : Curve → Type uPoint\n  Target : Type uTarget\n  CurveClass : Type uBeta\n  CohClass : Type uCoh\n  CycleClass : Type uCycle\n  Coeff : Type uCoeff\n  genus : Curve → Nat\n  isStableMap :\n    {C : Curve} → {n : Nat} →\n      (Fin n → Point C) →\n      (Point C → Target) →\n      CurveClass →\n      Prop\n\n/--\nA single stable-map witness relative to the predicates supplied by `Ctx`.\n-/\nstructure StableMapWitness\n    (Ctx : StableMapContext)\n    (g n : Nat)\n    (β : Ctx.CurveClass) where\n  source : Ctx.Curve\n  markings : Fin n → Ctx.Point source\n  toTarget : Ctx.Point source → Ctx.Target\n  genus_eq : Ctx.genus source = g\n  stable_ok : Ctx.isStableMap markings toTarget β\n\n/--\nCandidate moduli object.\n\n`representsStatement` is only the proposition that this object represents\nthe intended stable-map moduli problem. No proof is included.\n-/\nstructure StableMapModuliWitness\n    (Ctx : StableMapContext)\n    (g n : Nat)\n    (β : Ctx.CurveClass) where\n  Moduli : Type uMod\n  asStableMap : Moduli → StableMapWitness Ctx g n β\n  representsStatement : Prop\n\n/--\nCandidate virtual fundamental class packet.\n\nNo VFC existence, uniqueness, functoriality, or dimension theorem is asserted.\n-/\nstructure VirtualFundamentalClassWitness\n    {Ctx : StableMapContext}\n    {g n : Nat}\n    {β : Ctx.CurveClass}\n    (M : StableMapModuliWitness Ctx g n β) where\n  ObstructionTheory : Type uObst\n  virtualClass : Ctx.CycleClass\n  virtualDimension : Int\n  constructionStatement : Prop\n  functorialityStatement : Prop\n  orientationStatement : Prop\n  propernessStatement : Prop\n\n/--\nPrimary/descendant insertion data.\n-/\nstructure GWInsertion\n    (Ctx : StableMapContext)\n    (n : Nat) where\n  cohomology : Fin n → Ctx.CohClass\n  psiPower : Fin n → Nat\n\n/--\nCandidate GW invariant value.\n\nThe fields ending in `Statement` describe what would need to be proved.\nThey are not proofs.\n-/\nstructure GWInvariantWitness\n    {Ctx : StableMapContext}\n    {g n : Nat}\n    {β : Ctx.CurveClass}\n    (M : StableMapModuliWitness Ctx g n β)\n    (V : VirtualFundamentalClassWitness M) where\n  insertions : GWInsertion Ctx n\n  value : Ctx.Coeff\n  definitionStatement : Prop\n  dimensionMatchStatement : Prop\n  deformationInvarianceStatement : Prop\n\n/--\nCandidate quantum product packet.\n\nAssociativity, unit, and classical limit are proposition slots only.\n-/\nstructure QuantumProductWitness\n    (Ctx : StableMapContext) where\n  QH : Type uQH\n  Novikov : Type uNov\n  unit : QH\n  qmul : QH → QH → QH\n  classicalLimit : QH → Ctx.CohClass\n  coefficientGWStatement : Prop\n  associativityStatement : Prop\n  unitStatement : Prop\n  classicalLimitStatement : Prop\n\n/--\nCandidate mirror-comparison packet.\n\nThis does not assert mirror symmetry.\n-/\nstructure MirrorComparisonPacket\n    (A : StableMapContext) where\n  BModel : Type uBModel\n  ASeries : Type uASeries\n  BSeries : Type uBSeries\n  mirrorMap : ASeries → BSeries\n  targetHypothesesStatement : Prop\n  normalizationStatement : Prop\n  comparisonStatement : Prop\n\ninductive CorrespondenceKind where\n  | gwDT\n  | gwHurwitz\n\n/--\nCandidate correspondence packet: GW/DT, GW/Hurwitz, etc.\n\nThis is a container for a scoped comparison claim, not a theorem.\n-/\nstructure CorrespondenceCandidate\n    (kind : CorrespondenceKind) where\n  GWTheory : Type uQH\n  OtherTheory : Type uOther\n  Dictionary : Type uDict\n  scopeStatement : Prop\n  changeOfVariablesStatement : Prop\n  comparisonStatement : Prop\n  provenScopeStatement : Prop\n\nabbrev DTCorrespondenceCandidate :=\n  CorrespondenceCandidate CorrespondenceKind.gwDT\n\nabbrev HurwitzCorrespondenceCandidate :=\n  CorrespondenceCandidate CorrespondenceKind.gwHurwitz\n\n/--\nPromotion wrapper.\n\nUnlike a raw `...Statement : Prop` field, this requires an actual proof.\n-/\nstructure CertifiedStatement\n    (P : Prop) where\n  proof : P\n\nend GW.PrimaMateria\n","mtime":1778096490249}